# Clerestory proof for the emission channel and a multi-material piece: one 8x8
# open module walled in stone-framed stained-glass windows on tileset 14. Each
# wall is one piece clad from two atlases, the stone frame scene-lit and the
# glass emissive. The nave is kept dim (a single low brazier) so the glass reads
# by its own glow, not reflected torchlight. The floor and vault are cathedral
# stone.
map GLASSHALL
size 24 24
tileset 14
music 0
sector 0 0 128
walls
